# sample_text: the Notes field, typed into, read by character, word and
# line, a selection made and deleted; then the Name field. After each
# Tab the reader is asked what has the focus, as a user does (NVDA's
# Insert+Tab; Orca's walker and VoiceOver ask nothing): NVDA on the
# runner, which has no audio device, left half the moves into the
# fields unsaid while UI Automation had the field focused.
key Tab
focus
key Tab
focus
type hello world
key Left
hold ctrl Left
hold ctrl Left
hold ctrl Right
key End
hold shift Left
key BackSpace
key Return
type two
key Up
key Down
hold shift Tab
# Said by Orca, NVDA and VoiceOver alike.
expect Notes
expect hello
expect world
expect two
